# Gordon (29095) wants to walk the gordon route at 10 from its creation (a fixture template
# has no route of its alias, so it stands). 3 s after it appears, and every 3 s, it looks
# for Zariche or Akamanah within 500 of it: Zariche lies 200 away, so it wants to pick it up
# at 1000000. Its AI walks it there; arrived, it picks Zariche up, which leaves the world and
# ends its life (S1_HAS_DISAPPEARED to every player). Its departure 3 s later, its hunt of a
# cursed weapon's carrier and wielder are in tests/ai/raid_boss_test.go: the format checks no
# NPC's presence and gives a raid boss no aggro range to see in.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossStandard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossAlone.RaidBossType1.Gordon
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossAlone.RaidBossType1.RaidBossType1
item 8689
npc gordon 29095 RaidBoss 200 0 0 walks
ground zariche 8190 1 400 0 0 cursed

tick
  desires gordon move_route()=10
advance 3s
  desires gordon move_route()=10 pick_up()=1000000
tick x2
walk gordon
tick
  S DeleteObject obj=zariche
  S SystemMessage id=1818 3:8190
advance 3s
